{
  "category": "Balloon Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "When its huge eyes light up, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "When its huge eyes light up, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uses its alluring eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it inflates to SING a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking into its cute, round eyes causes it to sing a relaxing melody, inducing its enemies to sleep.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It rolls its cute eyes as it sings a soothing lullaby. Its gentle song puts anyone who hears it to sleep.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "JIGGLYPUFF’s vocal chords can freely adjust the wavelength of its voice. This POKéMON uses this ability to sing at precisely the right wavelength to make its foes most drowsy.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When this POKéMON sings, it never pauses to breathe. If it is in a battle against an opponent that does not easily fall asleep, JIGGLYPUFF cannot breathe, endangering its life.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing can avoid falling asleep hearing a JIGGLYPUFF’s song. The sound waves of its singing voice match the brain waves of someone in a deep sleep.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It captivates foes with its huge, round eyes, then lulls them to sleep by singing a soothing melody.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "When its huge eyes waver, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it inflates to sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking into its cute, round eyes causes it to sing a relaxing melody, inducing its enemies to sleep.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can’t help but fall asleep.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can’t help but fall asleep.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It captivates foes with its huge, round eyes, then lulls them to sleep by singing a soothing melody.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it inflates to sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jigglypuff’s vocal cords can freely adjust the wavelength of its voice. This Pokémon uses this ability to sing at precisely the right wavelength to make its foes most drowsy.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "When this Pokémon sings, it never pauses to breathe. If it is in a battle against an opponent that does not easily fall asleep, Jigglypuff cannot breathe, endangering its life.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hugely inflates its stomach and sings a mysterious melody. If you hear this melody, you’ll become sleepy right away.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jigglypuff possess a vocal range that exceeds 12 octaves, but each individual’s singing skill depends on its own effort.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Recordings of Jigglypuff’s strange lullabies can be purchased from department stores. These CDs can be found near the bedding area.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The songs they sing are totally different depending on the region they live in. Some even sound like they’re shouting!",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uses its cute round eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uses its cute round eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "Jigglypuff has top-notch lung capacity, even by comparison to other Pokémon. It won’t stop singing its lullabies until its foes fall asleep.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "By freely changing the wavelength of its voice, Jigglypuff sings a mysterious melody sure to make any listener sleepy.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
